1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,688
BRAMBLE: Case open!

2
00:00:01,688 --> 00:00:04,545
OTTO: Oh no! The till won't balance!

3
00:00:04,745 --> 00:00:07,766
IVY: The sheet and the money don't match.

4
00:00:08,166 --> 00:00:11,322
Today's case: the till that won't balance.

5
00:00:11,722 --> 00:00:15,181
OTTO: Eight and seven make fifteen. Write the five!

6
00:00:15,381 --> 00:00:19,037
OTTO: Three and two make five. 55 dollars!

7
00:00:19,437 --> 00:00:22,071
IVY: Hmm. Where did the ten go?

8
00:00:22,471 --> 00:00:26,253
Ten ones and one ten are worth the same.

9
00:00:26,653 --> 00:00:29,389
Eight and seven make fifteen ones.

10
00:00:29,789 --> 00:00:32,334
Swap ten ones for one ten.

11
00:00:32,934 --> 00:00:36,303
Now there are six tens and five ones.

12
00:00:36,703 --> 00:00:38,930
It's B! 65 dollars.

13
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:41,742
OTTO: Oh! I forgot the swapped ten!

14
00:00:42,142 --> 00:00:43,450
BRAMBLE: Case solved!

15
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:48,882
Say it with me. Ten ones and one ten are worth the same.

16
00:00:49,282 --> 00:00:52,574
Next case: ladybird dots at a glance.

